# QueryPlan — {调研方向名}

> 原理翻译四层：P0 原理名 → P1 机制词 → P2 指标词 → P3 场景词。
> 每个 primary_principle 至少 6 条 query（academic ≥2、cross-domain ≥2、realtime ≥1、trends ≥1），含中英双语，每条带 derived_from。

## 四层翻译

| 层 | 内容 |
|----|------|
| P0 原理名 | {中 / en} |
| P1 机制词 | {词1、词2…} |
| P2 指标词 | {指标1、指标2…} |
| P3 场景词 | {本书场景} |

## queries

```yaml
queries:
  - source: "academic"
    language: "en"
    query: "\"{原理词}\" \"{机制/指标词}\" review"
    derived_from: ["primary_principle", "measurable_variables.{x}"]
    intent: "{寻找前沿研究 / 经典文献 / 综述}"
  - source: "academic"
    language: "zh"
    query: "\"{原理词}\" {机制词} 综述"
    derived_from: ["primary_principle"]
    intent: "..."
  - source: "cross-domain-transfer"
    language: "{zh|en}"
    query: "\"{源领域}\" \"{本书场景}\" 迁移"
    derived_from: ["source_domains_to_probe.{x}", "target_domains.{y}"]
    intent: "寻找成熟方法迁移"
  - source: "cross-domain-transfer"
    language: "{zh|en}"
    query: "..."
    derived_from: [...]
    intent: "..."
  - source: "trends-standards"
    language: "{zh|en}"
    query: "\"{领域}\" 路线图/标准/白皮书 {年份}"
    derived_from: ["target_domains.{x}"]
    intent: "方向验证"
  - source: "realtime-search"
    language: "{zh|en}"
    query: "\"{原理词}\" breakthrough/latest/官方 {年份}"
    derived_from: ["primary_principle"]
    intent: "最新进展补缺"
```

## 排除词

{去掉营销软文、泛泛科普、无来源转载的否定词}

## Query 质量门自检

- [ ] 每个 primary_principle ≥ 6 条 query
- [ ] academic ≥ 2、cross-domain ≥ 2、realtime ≥ 1、trends ≥ 1
- [ ] 每个 query 含 ≥1 原理词 + ≥1 机制/指标词
- [ ] 高价值主题含中英双语
- [ ] 所有 query 有 derived_from
- [ ] 禁止只用作者原话或主题名检索
